7. Detect Person
GET    /api/detect-person-logs
GET    /api/detect-person-logs/{id}
GET    /api/detect-person-logs/camera/{cameraId}
GET    /api/detect-person-logs/user/{userId}
POST   /api/detect-person-logs
DELETE /api/detect-person-logs/{id}

POST upload ảnh: multipart/form-data
cameraId = CAM_001
userId   = 1
image    = file.jpg

PowerShell:
curl.exe -X POST "http://localhost:8080/api/detect-person-logs" `
  -F "cameraId=CAM_001" `
  -F "userId=1" `
  -F "image=@H:\security-multimedia\final-face\images\1\5.jpg"

Lấy lịch sử nhận diện camera
GET /api/detect-person-logs/camera/CAM_001

Lấy lịch sử nhận diện user
GET /api/detect-person-logs/user/1



